Package: python3-katzenpost-thinclient
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: thin client for the Katzenpost client daemon
 Talks to a running kpclientd over its unix socket so an application does
 not carry a mixnet client of its own. Provides the pigeonhole channel
 API, the transport layer and the CBOR wire codec.

Package: librust-katzenpost-thin-client-dev
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: async thin client for Katzenpost (Rust source)
 Talks to a running kpclientd over its unix socket so an application does
 not carry a mixnet client of its own.
 .
 This package ships the crate source under /usr/share/cargo/registry for
 use as a build dependency. The crates it depends on are not in Debian
 yet, so cargo resolves them from elsewhere.
